<title>FRANCE: Strauss-Kahn proxy for EU fin mins dinner Sunday.</title>
<headline>Strauss-Kahn proxy for EU fin mins dinner Sunday.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's new Socialist finance minister Dominique Strauss-Kahn will not attend the dinner for EU finance ministers on the evening before their Monday meeting in Luxembourg, a finance ministry official said on Friday.</p>
<p>Strauss-Kahn will arrive in Luxembourg on Monday morning and he will be represented at the Sunday evening dinner by Treasury director Jean Lemierre, the official said, without elaborating.</p>
</text>
